# Ford Granada Mk1 four-door saloon, 1972-1977.
#
# Ford's European executive car of the 1970s: 4,572 mm long, 1,791 mm wide,
# 1,364 mm high, 2,718 mm wheelbase; 2.0-3.0 V6 petrol and a 2.1 diesel. Car of
# the Year 1973 in Britain and the mainstay of the executive and police market.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Granada_(Europe)
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Green are documented Ford colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 160 in total (white 45, red 40, blue 40, green 35).
#
# Speed 180 km/h; comfort 105/488 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1972-1977 with a road tail to about 1989.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/ford-granada-mk1.blend. References:
# citycars/references/ford-granada-mk1/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

